## §1.8: Stratified Syntax & Sequent Calculus $\mathcal{L}_{\mathrm{iMSL}}$ {.smaller}

<div class="stratum-badge badge-b">STRATUM B: LAYER 3 PROOF THEORY &amp; INTERACTIVE RULE LEDGER</div>

:::: {.columns}

::: {.column width="42%"}

::: {.thm-box}
**Stratified Language $\mathbf{WFF}_{\mathrm{iMSL}}$**

* **Base ($\Gen_0$):** $\AP_S \sqcup \AP_0$, where $\AP_0 = \{a_0, \dots, a_N\}$ is the invariant **Metrophor** ($\mathfrak{M}$).
* **Inductive ($\Gen_{j+1}$):** $\operatorname{Conj}(\phi,\psi), \operatorname{Lift}_{\Box_{\mathrm{Syn}}}(\phi), \operatorname{ParaConj}(\phi)$ with $\Prop_k = \bigcup_{j=0}^k \Gen_j$.
* **Assertion Level $\mathcal{L}_k$:**
$$
\phi, \psi \Coloneqq P \mid \bot \mid \phi \wedge \psi \mid \phi \vee \psi \mid \phi \to \psi \mid \Stable_k(P) \mid \Box_{\mathrm{Syn}} P \mid \Box_S \phi \mid \Diamond_S \phi \mid [\pi_F]\phi \mid \langle\pi_F\rangle\phi
$$
:::

::: {.intuition-box .fragment}
**Key Forcing Clauses:**
$$
\begin{aligned}
(U, k) \models \Stable_{j+1}(P') &\iff (U, k) \models P' \;\wedge\; \forall X \big(\IGP_{j+1}(X, P') \Rightarrow (U, k) \models \Stable_j(X)\big)\\
(U, k) \models [\pi_F]\theta &\iff (U, k) \models \langle\pi_F\rangle\theta \iff (F(U), k+1) \models \theta
\end{aligned}
$$
:::

:::

::: {.column width="58%"}

::: {.interactive-panel}
#### Interactive Ledger: Complete Sequent Calculus $\mathcal{L}_{\mathrm{iMSL}}$ ($S(x); \Gamma \vdash^k \phi$)

<p class="widget-context-note">
  <b>Context (§1.8.2 &amp; App. A):</b> Click any of the 6 rule tabs below to inspect the single-succedent constructive inference rules governing structural deduction, intuitionistic connectives, aspectual coordination, Fischer–Servi modalities, hereditary stability, and dynamic functorial steps.
</p>
<div class="syn-tabs">
  <button class="syn-tab-btn active" onclick="showRuleTab(1, this)">1. Structural</button>
  <button class="syn-tab-btn" onclick="showRuleTab(2, this)">2. Intuitionistic</button>
  <button class="syn-tab-btn" onclick="showRuleTab(3, this)">3. Aspectual</button>
  <button class="syn-tab-btn" onclick="showRuleTab(4, this)">4. Fischer–Servi Modal</button>
  <button class="syn-tab-btn" onclick="showRuleTab(5, this)">5. Hereditary Stability</button>
  <button class="syn-tab-btn" onclick="showRuleTab(6, this)">6. Dynamic [π_F]</button>
</div>

::: {#rule-pane-1 .syn-tab-pane .active}
**1. Structural Rules ($\text{Ax}, \text{W}, \text{C}, \text{Cut}$)**
$$
\frac{}{S(x);\Gamma,\phi\vdash^k\phi}\,(\text{Ax})\qquad
\frac{S(x);\Gamma\vdash^k\phi}{S(x);\Gamma,\psi\vdash^k\phi}\,(\text{W})\qquad
\frac{S(x);\Gamma,\psi,\psi\vdash^k\phi}{S(x);\Gamma,\psi\vdash^k\phi}\,(\text{C})
$$
$$
\frac{S(x);\Gamma\vdash^k\psi\qquad S(x);\Delta,\psi\vdash^k\phi}{S(x);\Gamma,\Delta\vdash^k\phi}\,(\text{Cut — Admissible via Hauptsatz, Thm A.5})
$$
:::

::: {#rule-pane-2 .syn-tab-pane}
**2. Intuitionistic Single-Succedent Propositional Rules**
$$
\frac{S(x);\Gamma\vdash^k\phi\quad S(x);\Gamma\vdash^k\psi}{S(x);\Gamma\vdash^k\phi\wedge\psi}\,(\wedge R)\quad
\frac{S(x);\Gamma,\phi,\psi\vdash^k\chi}{S(x);\Gamma,\phi\wedge\psi\vdash^k\chi}\,(\wedge L)\quad
\frac{S(x);\Gamma\vdash^k\phi_i}{S(x);\Gamma\vdash^k\phi_1\vee\phi_2}\,(\vee R_i)
$$
$$
\frac{S(x);\Gamma,\phi\vdash^k\chi\quad S(x);\Gamma,\psi\vdash^k\chi}{S(x);\Gamma,\phi\vee\psi\vdash^k\chi}\,(\vee L)\quad
\frac{S(x);\Gamma,\phi\vdash^k\psi}{S(x);\Gamma\vdash^k\phi\to\psi}\,(\to R)\quad
\frac{S(x);\Gamma\vdash^k\phi\quad S(x);\Delta,\psi\vdash^k\chi}{S(x);\Gamma,\Delta,\phi\to\psi\vdash^k\chi}\,(\to L)
$$
:::

::: {#rule-pane-3 .syn-tab-pane}
**3. Aspectual Interface with $S_{\mathrm{mod}}(x)$**
$$
\frac{(S_{\mathrm{mod}}(x),k)\models p\quad(p\in\AP_S)}{S(x);\Gamma\vdash^k p}\,(\text{Fact-S}_A)
$$
$$
\frac{S(x);\Gamma\vdash^k(d_r,v_{dr})\quad S(x);\Delta\vdash^k(f_q,v_{fq})\quad [\operatorname{Strength}>\theta_{\mathrm{coord}}(x)]}{S(x);\Gamma,\Delta\vdash^k\operatorname{Coord}((d_r,v_{dr}),(f_q,v_{fq}))}\,(\chi\text{-I}_S)
$$
:::

::: {#rule-pane-4 .syn-tab-pane}
**4. Fischer–Servi Bi-Relational Modal Rules ($\Box_S, \Diamond_S$)**
$$
\frac{S(x);\Gamma\vdash^k\phi}{S(x);\Box_S\Gamma\vdash^k\Box_S\phi}\,(\Box_S K)\qquad
\frac{S(x);\Box_S\Gamma,\phi\vdash^k\Diamond_S\psi}{S(x);\Box_S\Gamma,\Diamond_S\phi\vdash^k\Diamond_S\psi}\,(\Diamond_S K)\qquad
\frac{S(x);\Box_S\Gamma\vdash^k\phi\to\psi}{S(x);\Diamond_S\Gamma\vdash^k\Diamond_S\phi\to\Diamond_S\psi}\,(\text{FS-Int})
$$
$$
\frac{S(x);\Gamma,\phi\vdash^k\chi}{S(x);\Gamma,\Box_S\phi\vdash^k\chi}\,(\Box_S\text{-Ref})\qquad
\frac{S(x);\Gamma\vdash^k\phi}{S(x);\Gamma\vdash^k\Diamond_S\phi}\,(\Diamond_S\text{-Ref})\qquad
\frac{S(x);\Gamma\vdash^k\Box_S\psi}{S(x);\Diamond_S(\bigwedge\Gamma)\vdash^k\psi}\,(B_{\Diamond\text{-Adj}})
$$
:::

::: {#rule-pane-5 .syn-tab-pane}
**5. Hereditary Stability Rules ($\Stable_k$)**
$$
\frac{a_i\in\AP_0\quad S(x);\Gamma\vdash^0 a_i}{S(x);\Gamma\vdash^0\Stable_0(a_i)}\,(\operatorname{Stab}_0R)\qquad
\frac{P'\in\Gen_{j+1}\quad S(x);\Gamma\vdash^{j+1}P'\quad (S(x);\Gamma|_{\le j}\vdash^j\Stable_j(X))_{\IGP_{j+1}(X,P')}}{S(x);\Gamma\vdash^{j+1}\Stable_{j+1}(P')}\,(\operatorname{Stab}_{j+1}R)
$$
$$
\frac{S(x);\Gamma,P'\vdash^{j+1}\chi}{S(x);\Gamma,\Stable_{j+1}(P')\vdash^{j+1}\chi}\,(\operatorname{Stab}L_1)\qquad
\frac{S(x);\Gamma|_{\le j},\Stable_j(X)\vdash^j\chi\quad (\IGP_{j+1}(X,P'))}{S(x);\Gamma,\Stable_{j+1}(P')\vdash^{j+1}\iota_{j,j+1}(\chi)}\,(\operatorname{Stab}L_2)
$$
:::

::: {#rule-pane-6 .syn-tab-pane}
**6. Deterministic Dynamic Modality Rules ($[\pi_F], \langle\pi_F\rangle$)**
$$
\frac{S(x);\Gamma\vdash^k\bigwedge_{i=1}^m\phi_i\quad (\psi=F_{\mathrm{ops}}(\vec\phi)\in\Prop_{k+1})}{S(x);\Gamma\vdash^k\langle\pi_F\rangle\psi}\,(\langle\pi_F\rangle FI)\qquad
\frac{S(x);\Gamma\vdash^k[\pi_F]\phi}{S(x);\Gamma\vdash^k\langle\pi_F\rangle\phi}\,([\pi_F]\leftrightarrow\langle\pi_F\rangle)
$$
$$
\frac{S(x);\Gamma\vdash^k[\pi_F]\phi}{S(x);\operatorname{Cons}(\Gamma,\pi_F)\vdash^{k+1}\phi}\,([\pi_F]\text{-App})\qquad
\frac{S(x);[\pi_F]\Gamma\vdash^k[\pi_F]\theta}{k+1;\Gamma\vdash\theta}\,([\pi_F]\text{-Step/Unstep})
$$
:::

:::

:::

::::

::: {.notes}
Layer 3 provides the syntactic proof engine: the intuitionistic Leveled Modal Syndromatic Logic L_iMSL. Using the 6 tabs on the right, you can inspect the complete single-succedent sequent calculus, including the Fischer-Servi modal interaction rules, Hereditary Stability rules anchored in the Metrophor AP_0, and the deterministic level-stepping modality [pi_F].
:::

